From: Andrew Mello <andrew@88plug.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 21:30:00 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] envoy_gateway: keep a newer Gateway API install (release-1.2)

gateway-helm v1.7.1 carries Gateway API v1.4.1's CRDs in crds/, which helm
creates on install. k3s v1.37 bundles newer Gateway API CRDs (its
gateway-api-crd addon), and Gateway API v1.5.0 and later ship the
safe-upgrades.gateway.networking.k8s.io ValidatingAdmissionPolicy, which
refuses every create of a lower version, so the install stops:

  Error: failed to install CRD crds/gatewayapi-crds.yaml: 12 errors occurred:
    * customresourcedefinitions.apiextensions.k8s.io
      "gatewayclasses.gateway.networking.k8s.io" is forbidden: ValidatingAdmissionPolicy
      'safe-upgrades.gateway.networking.k8s.io' ... denied request: Installing CRDs
      with version before v1.5.0 is prohibited by default.

When gatewayclasses carries a gateway.networking.k8s.io/bundle-version of
v1.5.0 or later, Envoy Gateway's own CRDs (gateway.envoyproxy.io) are
rendered from its gateway-crds-helm chart at the same version with the
Gateway API part off, applied server-side, and the release is installed
with skip_crds. That is what EAS main's gateway role does since EAS #42
(roles/envoy_gateway/tasks/crds.yaml: "Off when newer foreign Gateway API
CRDs are already in place"); without a newer install nothing changes.
---
--- a/roles/envoy_gateway/tasks/install.yaml
+++ b/roles/envoy_gateway/tasks/install.yaml
@@ -20,6 +20,54 @@
 - name: "envoy_gateway | Install"
   when: _eg_release.status is not defined or _eg_release.status is none
   block:
+    # A newer Gateway API install another tool owns stays: k3s v1.37 bundles the CRDs (its
+    # gateway-api-crd addon), and from Gateway API v1.5.0 their safe-upgrades
+    # ValidatingAdmissionPolicy refuses the older ones this chart carries in crds/. Then
+    # Envoy Gateway's own CRDs come from its gateway-crds-helm chart, applied server-side,
+    # and the chart's crds/ are skipped, as EAS main's gateway role does (EAS #42).
+    - name: "envoy_gateway | Read the installed Gateway API version"
+      kubernetes.core.k8s_info:
+        api_version: apiextensions.k8s.io/v1
+        kind: CustomResourceDefinition
+        name: gatewayclasses.gateway.networking.k8s.io
+      register: _eg_gateway_api_crd
+
+    - name: "envoy_gateway | Keep a Gateway API install at v1.5.0 or later"
+      ansible.builtin.set_fact:
+        _eg_keep_gateway_api: >-
+          {{ (_eg_gateway_api_crd.resources | default([]) | length > 0)
+             and (((_eg_gateway_api_crd.resources[0].metadata.annotations | default({}, true))
+                   ['gateway.networking.k8s.io/bundle-version'] | default('v0.0.0', true) | regex_replace('^v', ''))
+                  is version('1.5.0', '>=')) }}
+
+    - name: "envoy_gateway | Render Envoy Gateway's own CRDs"
+      kubernetes.core.helm_template:
+        chart_ref: oci://docker.io/envoyproxy/gateway-crds-helm
+        chart_version: "v{{ envoy_gateway_version }}"
+        include_crds: true
+        values:
+          crds:
+            gatewayAPI:
+              enabled: false
+            envoyGateway:
+              enabled: true
+      register: _eg_crds_rendered
+      until: _eg_crds_rendered is succeeded
+      retries: "{{ helm_retries }}"
+      delay: 15
+      changed_when: false
+      when: _eg_keep_gateway_api | bool
+
+    - name: "envoy_gateway | Apply Envoy Gateway's own CRDs (server-side)"
+      kubernetes.core.k8s:
+        state: present
+        apply: true
+        server_side_apply:
+          field_manager: envoy-gateway-crds
+          force_conflicts: true
+        definition: "{{ _eg_crds_rendered.stdout | from_yaml_all | select | list }}"
+      when: _eg_keep_gateway_api | bool
+
     - name: "envoy_gateway | Install Envoy Gateway via Helm (OCI) — standalone"
       kubernetes.core.helm:
         name: envoy-gateway
@@ -27,6 +75,7 @@
         release_namespace: "{{ envoy_gateway_namespace }}"
         create_namespace: true
         chart_version: "v{{ envoy_gateway_version }}"
+        skip_crds: "{{ _eg_keep_gateway_api | bool }}"
         wait: "{{ helm_wait }}"
         timeout: "{{ helm_timeout }}"
         values:
